        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-24T13:06:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I've forgotten on a couple of occasions when spending Boosts in the first part of a round - I need to remember to wait until at least the \"Get Credits\" bit has been done so I have my money, then I can use them before the \"Requisition Stuff\" bit or wait a bit longer in the round.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There have been times I needed to Strike Force Tactics a ship during [T] so it didn't activate during [R]. Looking at you Smugglers!</p>",
